              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. May upgrade to partial plate armour (free if mounted). May have a lance (+4 pts) and must have a warhorse (free). Warhorse may have cloth barding (+4 pts). Mounted Knights are Impetuous and have First Charge. 0-1 unit. (Armies of Chivalry p.16)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="edc7-5233-5334-9c34" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">3+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
                <!-- armour-save -->
              <modifier type="set" field="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024" value="2+ with Cloth barding +1 in hand-to-hand only">
