              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. May upgrade to partial plate armour (+2 pts if dismounted). May have a halberd (+3 pts) or a double-handed weapon (+3 pts) if dismounted. Dismounted Knights are Stubborn and can have Different Weapons. 0-1 unit. (Armies of Chivalry p.16)</characteristic>
