  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="db48-e8ff-131f-e6fd" name="Scotland &amp; the Borders (Armies of Chivalry) - List Notes" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false">
      <description>SCOTLAND &amp; THE BORDERS c.1250-1513 (Armies of Chivalry, pp.16-17). One Noble may be the Army Standard Bearer (+15 pts), hand weapon only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Scotland &amp; the Borders]
  Characters: up to 20%
  Cavalry: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 100%
  Archers: up to 10%
  Characters 0-20%, Cavalry 0-25%, Infantry 0-100%, Archers 0-10%.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
